Open a text editor (Notepad, VS Code, etc.)
Copy the entire XML content above
Save as sitemap.xml (UTF-8 encoding)

Step 2: Upload to GitHub
Go to: https://github.com/houseforsellaroundme/houseforsellaroundme.github.io
Navigate to independent-house-for-sell folder
Click "Add file" → "Upload files"
Drag and drop sitemap.xml
Commit message: "Update sitemap with 24 property photos and category pages"
Click "Commit changes"

Step 3: Verify
After 1-2 minutes, visit:
https://houseforsellaroundme.github.io/independent-house-for-sell/sitemap.xml

Step 4: Resubmit to Search Engines

Google Search Console:
Go to Google Search Console
Select your property
Navigate to Sitemaps
Enter: sitemap.xml
Click Submit

Bing Webmaster Tools:
Go to Bing Webmaster Tools
Select your site
Navigate to Sitemaps
Submit: https://houseforsellaroundme.github.io/independent-house-for-sell/sitemap.xml

